  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Children to Read and Connect!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Libraries are safe havens for kids, providing after-school homework help, games, and book clubs. Reading breeds curiosity and stimulates the imagination and appetite for writing one&apos;s own stories.  At Hope for Youth school, many children find the time for the library their best time at school because they want to listen to their teachers read stories about places and children of the world.  This library is now a place where they discover the heroes in their lives.</narrative>
  </description>
